    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A closed unit maintains a clean interior, so cyclists receive their bikes dust‑free. Open trailers allow fine particles to settle on gears and brakes, increasing maintenance needs.</p>
